      "status": "confirmed printed discrepancy",
      "locator": "PES main PDF p.4, Section 2.2, C3",
      "observation": "The C3 heading and Eq.8 on p.5 use f(x)<f(x_star), whereas the following all-z comparison reverses the intended maximum inequality.",
      "handling": "Retain maximum convention and cite the heading, preceding constraint description and Eq.8; do not silently repeat the reversed universal comparison."
