      "status": "confirmed unresolved notation",
      "locator": "PES main PDF p.5, paragraph after Eq.9",
      "observation": "The stability paragraph tests s, which is not defined there; Eq.9 defines v for the variance of f(x_star)-f(x).",
      "handling": "State the nondegenerate v>0 domain of the analytic formula. The printed stabilization is not treated as a complete verified implementation or silently repaired by substitution."
