      "locator": "Main PDF p.2, Sections2–3, Eqs4–5"
    },
    {
      "claim": "Approximate the conditional latent marginal by the ordinary Gaussian truncated above each sampled maximum m. For s_t(x)>0 use gamma=(m-mu_t(x))/s_t(x) and average gamma*phi(gamma)/(2*Phi(gamma))-log(Phi(gamma)). This is the named acquisition approximation, not exact noisy conditional information.",
