      "locator": "Main PDF p.3 Section3.1/Algorithm1; supplement PDF pp.1–2"
    },
    {
      "claim": "MES-R samples finite random Fourier-feature posterior functions for a suitable stationary covariance and numerically maximizes each function. With normalized spectral measure and amplitude handling this approximates GP maximum draws; neither finite features nor a numerical optimizer guarantees exact global maxima.",
