      "handling": "Omit a general regret/convergence claim. Literal proof details requiring a separate audit include integer block lengths, time-indexed confidence terms at selected times t_i versus the final zeta_T, and extension from fixed independent draws to adaptive posterior laws. This task does not present a repaired theorem or a counterexample to its final numerical bound."
